WEBVTT

02:02.320 --> 02:06.460
<i>When I'm alone, I can breathe</i>

02:06.460 --> 02:10.620
<i>In a world with no one 
but me, I feel at ease</i>

02:11.280 --> 02:15.640
<i>But I think the truth is</i>

02:15.640 --> 02:21.620
<i>That I've been waiting for 
morning's light to break through</i>

02:19.120 --> 02:27.380
<b>The Weakest Tamer
Began a Journey
to Pick Up Trash</b>

02:19.280 --> 02:21.620
<i>(Where could it be?)</i>

02:21.620 --> 02:24.870
<i>Beyond the edges of a yet unknown map</i>

02:24.870 --> 02:29.130
<i>That's where I'll find a place 
where I can live</i>

02:27.380 --> 02:29.130
<i>(If it exists...)</i>

02:29.130 --> 02:31.140
<i>I'd like to go there</i>

02:31.140 --> 02:34.890
<i>And with trembling legs, 
I take a step forward</i>

02:34.890 --> 02:37.480
<i>I'm on a journey without end</i>

02:37.480 --> 02:39.790
<i>And even if I carry nothing with me</i>

02:39.790 --> 02:41.940
<i>I'll take everything I feel</i>

02:41.940 --> 02:43.900
<i>And pack it into my once empty bag</i>

02:43.900 --> 02:45.720
<i>I'll go as far as I need to</i>

02:45.720 --> 02:47.940
<i>On this journey to find myself</i>

02:47.940 --> 02:50.030
<i>And everything I'm given along the way</i>

02:50.030 --> 02:54.490
<i>Will slowly fill my heart to the brim</i>

03:04.360 --> 03:08.720
<i>Now, I'm not all alone anymore</i>

03:08.720 --> 03:13.640
<i>Because I've met new, dear friends</i>

03:13.640 --> 03:18.390
<i>(Maybe we can understand each other 
because we're alike. Isn't it strange?)</i>

03:18.390 --> 03:21.600
<i>Your bright laughter gives me courage</i>

03:21.600 --> 03:25.860
<i>(I feel like I'm wrapped up 
snugly by your warmth)</i>

03:25.860 --> 03:31.110
<i>From now on, let's stay 
together forever and ever</i>

03:31.980 --> 03:36.990
<b>To a Dangerous Town</b>

22:11.000 --> 22:14.590
<i>You are not alone</i>

22:14.590 --> 22:18.150
<i>Open your eyes</i>

22:18.150 --> 22:19.940
<i>That’s the way</i>

22:19.940 --> 22:24.640
<i>You’ll be fine</i>

22:24.640 --> 22:28.720
<i>All of us are here now</i>

22:28.720 --> 22:34.540
<i>You’re something special</i>

22:34.540 --> 22:41.810
<i>Please just relax, and move forward</i>

22:42.800 --> 22:47.220
<i>Because you are here now</i>

22:47.220 --> 22:52.080
<i>The world is so beautiful</i>

22:52.080 --> 22:57.830
<i>This place is full of light</i>

22:57.830 --> 23:04.450
<i>You had countless nights of tears</i>

23:04.450 --> 23:11.840
<i>But you walked all the way here</i>

23:11.840 --> 23:18.160
<i>If it’s dark we’ll be your light</i>

23:18.160 --> 23:27.990
<i>You see the end of this road 
is crystal clear</i>
